{"seq":2,"slug":"data-scaling-behavior","title":"数据侧的扩展行为","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/pretraining-data-engineering/mixtures-curriculum/data-scaling-behavior","wordCount":1800,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"数据侧的扩展行为\">数据侧的扩展行为</h1><p>2022 年的 Chinchilla 论文重排了整个行业的算力账本：在七十亿到七百亿参数区间、五亿到五千亿 token 的实验网格里，作者发现计算最优训练要求模型规模与数据量同步翻倍——每把参数翻一倍，token 也该翻一倍（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2203.15556\">Chinchilla</a>）。数据从此不再是&quot;模型定好后剩下的预算&quot;，而是与参数平起平坐的一等公民。但同步扩展立刻撞上一堵现实的墙：世界上干净可用的文本到底够不够？研究数据侧扩展行为，就是回答&quot;当 token 不够时会发生什么、该做什么&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>扩展分析关心损失函数如何随两个资源变化。Chinchilla 的参数化把损失拆成三项：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>N</mi><mi>α</mi></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>B</mi><msup><mi>D</mi><mi>β</mi></msup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L(N, D) = E + \\frac{A}{N^{\\alpha}} + \\frac{B}{D^{\\beta}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5904em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7751em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.34</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha \\approx 0.34</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.34</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.28</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta \\approx 0.28</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.28</span></span></span></span></span>，两项分别刻画参数不足与数据不足造成的不可约损失（数值随实现浮动，趋势稳健）。当唯一可用数据量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>unique</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{\\text{unique}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">unique</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 无法支撑计算预算要求的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>D</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D^\\ast</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时，就进入<strong>数据受限机制</strong>，此时有四条出路：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A{&quot;唯一数据&lt;br/&gt;不够计算最优?&quot;} --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| B[&quot;重复已有数据&lt;br/&gt;多 epoch&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| C[&quot;生成合成数据&lt;br/&gt;改写 / 新造&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| D[&quot;外部获取&lt;br/&gt;授权采购&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| E[&quot;缩小模型&lt;br/&gt;降低 D*&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; F[&quot;评估边际价值衰减&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; F&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;重新平衡&lt;br/&gt;算力分配&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A{\"唯一数据&lt;br/&gt;不够计算最优?\"} --&gt;|\"是\"| B[\"重复已有数据&lt;br/&gt;多 epoch\"]\n    A --&gt;|\"是\"| C[\"生成合成数据&lt;br/&gt;改写 / 新造\"]\n    A --&gt;|\"是\"| D[\"外部获取&lt;br/&gt;授权采购\"]\n    A --&gt;|\"是\"| E[\"缩小模型&lt;br/&gt;降低 D*\"]\n    B --&gt; F[\"评估边际价值衰减\"]\n    C --&gt; F\n    D --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G[\"重新平衡&lt;br/&gt;算力分配\"]</pre><h2 id=\"重复训练-边际价值递减定律\">重复训练：边际价值递减定律</h2><p>数据受限机制下最便宜的选择是把同一批数据过好几遍。Muennighoff 等人的系统实验给出了迄今最有操作价值的结论：在九千 token 级别以下、九十亿参数以下的实验范围内，重复不超过四个 epoch 几乎不带来损失惩罚——等效于免费扩充了数据；超过四轮后，继续追加算力的价值一路衰减直至归零（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2305.16264\">Scaling Data-Constrained LMs</a>）。他们据此提出了带重复项的扩展律：有效数据量可以写成</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>eff</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>unique</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mi>R</mi></munderover><msup><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mtext> </mtext><mi>r</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{\\text{eff}} = D_{\\text{unique}} \\cdot \\left(1 + \\sum_{r=2}^{R} \\gamma^{\\,r-1}\\right), \\quad 0 &lt; \\gamma &lt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">eff</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">unique</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0954em;vertical-align:-1.2671em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2671em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>每一轮重复的贡献按几何级数打折。这条定律把&quot;能重复几遍&quot;变成了可以代入预算计算的显式变量，而不是拍脑袋的经验值。它同时定义了一个战略指标——数据受限上限：给定语料的唯一 token 数，超过某个模型规模的继续堆参数都是浪费。</p>\n<h2 id=\"质量-数量交换曲线\">质量—数量交换曲线</h2><p>另一条自由度是用质量换数量。FineWeb-Edu 的分层子集证明，固定训练预算下高教育分语料大幅跑赢全量语料；但 Nemotron-CC 从反方向提醒：把过滤开到最狠会丢掉九成原料，在长 token 预算下反而吃亏，温和分级加合成改写的折中在十五万亿 token 尺度上更划算（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2412.02595\">Nemotron-CC</a>、<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2406.17557\">FineWeb</a>）。两相合并可以得到一条非单调的直觉：<strong>最优过滤强度是训练预算的增函数</strong>——小预算尽管挑最精华的吃，大预算必须为尾部质量留席位。这条曲线对小型模型尤其陡峭：SmolLM2 以数据中心配方反复打磨有限预算下的每个环节，展示了小模型时代&quot;单位 token 含金量&quot;的极致追求（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2502.02737\">SmolLM2</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推理时代的再平衡\">推理时代的再平衡</h2><p>Chinchilla 给的是训练计算最优，而产品关心的是总拥有成本。一个训练完成后要服务亿万次推理请求的模型，每次推理都要为它的参数付显存与带宽账单——于是工业界的实际选择系统性偏离纯计算最优：宁可训得更久、喂更多 token，也要把模型做小。这等于人为把自己推进数据受限机制，反过来放大了本篇全部议题的权重：重复轮次要精打细算，<a href=\"mixture-design\">配比</a>要用代理实验压榨，蒸馏与多语言覆盖成为标配设计（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2503.19786\">Gemma 3</a> 即在此逻辑下强调轻量化与长上下文）。数据工程从支持角色升格为扩展战略本身。</p>\n<h2 id=\"撞墙之后-四条出路的取舍表\">撞墙之后：四条出路的取舍表</h2><p>回到 mermaid 图里的分叉口，各选项的真实成本结构值得摆在一起看：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>出路</th>\n<th>边际成本</th>\n<th>主要风险</th>\n<th>适用条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>重复 epoch</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>四轮后收益趋零</td>\n<td>差口不大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合成生成</td>\n<td>中（生成+验证算力）</td>\n<td>分布窄化、自我循环</td>\n<td>有强教师模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外部授权</td>\n<td>高（现金）</td>\n<td>合同与合规复杂</td>\n<td>缺口集中于特定域</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缩小模型</td>\n<td>低（放弃部分能力）</td>\n<td>产品目标受限</td>\n<td>数据硬上限明确</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>把核算步骤固定下来能避免临场拍脑袋：先由唯一 token 数算出数据受限上限；再把四轮以内的重复当作免费扩充计入供给；然后按剩余缺口在合成与采购之间分配；最后随预算上调过滤强度、但始终为尾部分位保留席位。这套流程的价值不在精度而在纪律——它逼着每个假设显式出现在账面上。</p>\n<p>值得注意的是第一条与第二条的深层关联：合成数据本质上是在赌&quot;新造的 token 是否像没见过的自然数据一样值钱&quot;，这正是下一篇的主题。而在动用任何出路之前，别忘了先审计你的库存——<a href=\"../cleaning-filtering/deduplication\">去重策略</a>的松紧直接改变了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>unique</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{\\text{unique}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">unique</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的读数，过于激进的去重会让你以为撞墙了，其实只是把同一批 token 数了两遍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"消融尺度与外推风险\">消融尺度与外推风险</h2><p>数据侧扩展结论几乎都来自小模型网格，把结论搬上正式训练之前必须理解外推的边界。DCLM 测试床为此提供了标准化参照：其受控实验覆盖从四亿到七十亿参数的多个尺度，让过滤与配比策略在统一评测下比较跨尺度的稳定性（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2406.11794\">DataComp-LM</a>）。经验规律是方向性结论（高质量语料更好）外推稳健，数值性结论（最优阈值、最优重复轮次）外推脆弱。操作上建议保留一档中间规模的确认实验：它花掉总预算的百分之一量级，却能在放大前暴露阈值失配。FineWeb 团队公开了消融全程的全部中间模型，正是为了让社区能复核每条曲线的外推可信度。</p>\n<p>另一个容易忽略的变量是训练时长本身：同样的 token 预算，摊在一个 epoch 还是四个 epoch 上，最优配比并不相同——重复会放大高质子集的作用，因为模型对它们有更多次采样机会。因此扩展行为不是一条独立曲线，而是与<a href=\"mixture-design\">混合设计</a>、调度策略耦合的三变量问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>计算最优要求参数与 token 同步翻倍；数据不够时，四轮以内重复几乎免费，此后边际价值指数衰减。</li>\n<li>最优过滤强度随训练预算增长而非单调，质量—数量交换是预算的函数。</li>\n<li>推理时代的成本压力把所有团队推进数据受限区，让扩展结论从学术细节变成战略输入。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"数据侧的扩展行为","id":"数据侧的扩展行为"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"重复训练：边际价值递减定律","id":"重复训练-边际价值递减定律"},{"level":2,"text":"质量—数量交换曲线","id":"质量-数量交换曲线"},{"level":2,"text":"推理时代的再平衡","id":"推理时代的再平衡"},{"level":2,"text":"撞墙之后：四条出路的取舍表","id":"撞墙之后-四条出路的取舍表"},{"level":2,"text":"消融尺度与外推风险","id":"消融尺度与外推风险"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"混合设计：FineWeb-Edu 与配比实验","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/pretraining-data-engineering/mixtures-curriculum/mixture-design"},"next":{"title":"合成数据进入预训练","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/pretraining-data-engineering/mixtures-curriculum/synthetic-in-pretraining"}}